                                "text": "Anything can become a phobic stimulus."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f5f31ee5-81a1-3151-a6b7-bba2a8414e9e",
                        "entry_id": "748a5f91-62e4-3ea2-942e-b7a80e81a577",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Experiencing or expressing phobia (strong fear and/or dislike)."
